OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple caught in dangerous
OL,4,Adriving crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FMultiple people were caught over the
OL,7,Fweekend as part of a police crackdown
OL,8,Fon dangerous driving.
OL,10,FJersey Police officers used mobile
OL,11,Fspeed cameras at several locations,
OL,12,Fincluding St Johns Village, Victoria
OL,13,FAvenue, and Westmount Road.
OL,15,FThey said a 33-year-old man was
OL,16,Farrested for drink-driving after a
OL,17,Fcrash on Saturday, and that 17 others
OL,18,Fwere ordered to attend parish hall
OL,19,Fhearings. Six people were warned for
OL,20,Fspeeding.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
